{"results":[{"record_id":"full_2026-07-06__rec_001291","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"yes","primary_exclusion_code":"EC3_not_generative","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The paper presents a self-supervised whole-genome representation model, but the described objective is masked-language modeling and representation learning rather than a clearly generative decoder/autoregressive system. It does show broad pretraining on hundreds of thousands of bacterial genomes and general-purpose representations predictive of many phenotypes.","evidence_snippet":"\"self-supervised learning to train a longcontext gLM\"; \"Anovel multi-task pretraining objective was used. In addition to masked-language modeling (MLM)\"; \"multi-task pretraining on a phylogenetically diverse dataset of hundreds of thousands of bacterial genomes\"; \"general-purpose whole-genome representations\"; \"predictive of a broad range of phenotypes\"; \"bacterial genomes as sequences of a vocabulary of genomic elements\"; \"train a longcontext gLM to model the relationships\"; \"more predictive than standard protein domain presence/absence representations for 23/25 different phenotypes\"; \"robust to both poor genome assembly quality and incompleteness\"; \"not gene order\"],"},{"record_id":"full_2026-07-06__rec_001291","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"yes","primary_exclusion_code":"EC3_not_generative","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The candidate is a self-supervised whole-genome representation learner, not a clearly generative model in the strict sense required here. The full text does provide foundation-model-like evidence through large-scale pretraining and general-purpose, transferable genome representations.","evidence_snippet":"\"self-supervised whole-genome representation learning\"; \"masked-language modeling (MLM)\"; \"hundreds of thousands of bacterial genomes\"; \"general-purpose whole-genome representations\"; \"predictive of bacterial phenotypes\"; \"robust to poor genome quality and incompleteness\""}]}
